#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "How to initialize your Qiskit Runtime account, instantiate your account, and load saved credentials."
msgid "How to initialize your IBM Quantum Compute Service account, instantiate your account, and load saved credentials."
msgstr "Paano i-initialize ang iyong Qiskit Runtime account, i-instantiate ang iyong account, at i-load ang mga naka-save na credentials."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Initialize your Qiskit Runtime service account"
msgid "Initialize your IBM Quantum Compute Service account"
msgstr "I-initialize ang iyong Qiskit Runtime service account"

#. type: Title #
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Initialize your Qiskit Runtime service account {#initialize-your-qiskit-runtime-service-account}"
msgid "Initialize your IBM Quantum Compute Service account {#initialize-your-ibm-quantum-compute-service-account}"
msgstr "I-initialize ang iyong Qiskit Runtime service account {#initialize-your-qiskit-runtime-service-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Before using Qiskit Runtime, you have to initialize (instantiate) your account by submitting (loading) credentials.  These credentials can be manually submitted each time you initialize the Qiskit Runtime service, or you can save them for reuse.\n"
msgid "Before using the IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service, you have to initialize (instantiate) your account by submitting (loading) credentials.  These credentials can be manually submitted each time you initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service, or you can save them for reuse.\n"
msgstr "Bago gamitin ang Qiskit Runtime, kailangan mong i-initialize (i-instantiate) ang iyong account sa pamamagitan ng pag-submit (pag-load) ng mga credentials. Maaaring manu-manong i-submit ang mga credentials na ito sa bawat oras na i-initialize mo ang Qiskit Runtime service, o maaari mo itong i-save para magamit ulit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mga Tala\">\n"
"      * Kung gumagamit ka ng pampublikong computer o ibang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang environment, sundin ang mga tagubilin sa [I-initialize ang service sa isang hindi pinagkakatiwalaang environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) sa halip.\n"
"      * Sundin ang [mga tagubiling ito](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) kung gusto mong kumonekta gamit ang REST API sa halip na Qiskit.\n"
"      * Kung kinakailangan, gamitin ang [impormasyong ito](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) para i-configure ang iyong firewall upang ma-enable ang access sa mga IBM Quantum API endpoint.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bago ka magsimula {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that you have completed these steps:\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking natapos mo na ang mga hakbang na ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that you are a member of an IBM Cloud account.  See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for instructions.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking miyembro ka ng isang IBM Cloud account. Tingnan ang [I-set up ang iyong IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) para sa mga tagubilin.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create (or have access to) at least one instance. Follow these steps to verify:\n"
msgstr "Gumawa (o magkaroon ng access) sa kahit isang instance. Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para ma-verify:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Mag-log in sa [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking ang tamang account at rehiyon ay napili sa account switcher sa header.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have one or more instances shown, you're done with this step. Otherwise, [create an instance](/guides/instances#add-instance).\n"
msgstr "Kung mayroon kang isa o higit pang instances na ipinapakita, tapos ka na sa hakbang na ito. Kung wala, [gumawa ng instance.](/guides/instances#add-instance)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [Qiskit SDK and Qiskit Runtime installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [Qiskit SDK and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking nagtatrabaho ka sa isang aktibong Python environment na may [Qiskit SDK at Qiskit Runtime na naka-install.](/guides/install-qiskit#local)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "I-activate ang Python virtual environment at patakbuhin ang Python sa iyong virtual environment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Hanapin ang iyong mga access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key (also referred to as an  _API token_). From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. The token will not be visible again. Note that you can use a single API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Hanapin ang iyong API key (tinutukoy rin bilang _API token_). Mula sa [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), gumawa ng iyong API key, pagkatapos kopyahin ito sa isang ligtas na lokasyon para magamit mo ito sa authentication. Hindi na muling makikita ang token. Tandaan na maaari kang gumamit ng isang API key para kumonekta sa anumang rehiyon.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Opsyonal: Hanapin ang instance na gusto mong gamitin mula sa pahina ng [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). I-hover ang cursor sa ibabaw ng CRN nito, i-click ang icon para kopyahin ito, pagkatapos i-save ito sa isang ligtas na lokasyon para magamit mo ito para matukoy ang instance.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Connect Qiskit with your Qiskit Runtime service instance {#connect-qiskit-with-your-qiskit-runtime-service-instance}"
msgid "Connect Qiskit with your IBM Quantum Compute Service instance {#connect-qiskit-with-your-ibm-quantum-compute-service-instance}"
msgstr "Ikonekta ang Qiskit sa iyong Qiskit Runtime service instance {#connect-qiskit-with-your-qiskit-runtime-service-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"These instructions are designed for `qiskit_ibm_runtime` v0.42 or later. Some features are not enabled in earlier versions of `qiskit_ibm_runtime`. In these cases, you should always provide a value for `channel`, `token`, and `instance`, either explicitly or through a saved account.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang mga tagubiling ito ay dinisenyo para sa `qiskit_ibm_runtime` v0.42 o mas bago. Hindi pinapagana ang ilang feature sa mas lumang bersyon ng `qiskit_ibm_runtime`. Sa mga kasong ito, dapat kang palaging magbigay ng value para sa `channel`, `token`, at `instance`, alinman nang tahasan o sa pamamagitan ng naka-save na account.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "The basic code to connect Qiskit with your Qiskit Runtime service instance follows.  However, there are several different ways to customize the `QiskitRuntimeService` options, depending on your needs.  These options are described in the following sections.\n"
msgid "The basic code to connect Qiskit with your Quantum Compute instance follows.  However, there are several different ways to customize the `QiskitRuntimeService` options, depending on your needs.  These options are described in the following sections.\n"
msgstr "Ang pangunahing code para ikonekta ang Qiskit sa iyong Qiskit Runtime service instance ay sumusunod. Gayunpaman, mayroong ilang iba't ibang paraan para i-customize ang mga opsyon ng `QiskitRuntimeService`, depende sa iyong mga pangangailangan. Inilarawan ang mga opsyong ito sa mga sumusunod na seksyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The default channel is `ibm_quantum_platform`.  Because this is almost always the appropriate channel, it is not included in the examples.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ang default na channel ay `ibm_quantum_platform`. Dahil ito ay halos palaging ang naaangkop na channel, hindi ito kasama sa mga halimbawa.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"explicit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"explicit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start path: Specify credentials explicitly {#quick-start-path-specify-credentials-explicitly}"
msgstr "Mabilis na simula: Tukuyin ang mga credentials nang tahasan {#quick-start-path-specify-credentials-explicitly}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "The fastest way to get a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance running is the direct instantiation method: explicitly provide the API token (key) and CRN (instance identifier) every time you need to initialize the Qiskit Runtime service. See [Find your access credentials](#access-credentials) if necessary.\n"
msgid "The fastest way to get a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance running is the direct instantiation method: explicitly provide the API token (key) and CRN (instance identifier) every time you need to initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service. See [Find your access credentials](#access-credentials) if necessary.\n"
msgstr "Ang pinakamabilis na paraan para mapatakbo ang isang `QiskitRuntimeService` instance ay ang direktang instantiation method: tahasan na ibigay ang API token (key) at CRN (instance identifier) sa bawat oras na kailangan mong i-initialize ang Qiskit Runtime service. Tingnan ang [Hanapin ang iyong mga access credentials](#access-credentials) kung kinakailangan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This path is reliable but can be tedious if you need to load the same details repeatedly. To avoid loading your credentials multiple times, if you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation), you can use saved account credentials, as described in the following section.\n"
msgstr "Maaasahan ang landas na ito ngunit maaaring nakakapagod kung kailangan mong paulit-ulit na i-load ang parehong mga detalye. Para maiwasan ang paulit-ulit na pag-load ng iyong mga credentials, kung nagtatrabaho ka sa isang pinagkakatiwalaang Python environment (tulad ng sa isang personal na laptop o workstation), maaari kang gumamit ng naka-save na mga credentials ng account, tulad ng inilarawan sa sumusunod na seksyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Although the `instance` input parameter is optional, it is recommended that you always provide this information, unless you want to use a single service to work with several instances. In this situation, see the [automatic instance selection](#auto-select) section.\n"
msgstr "Bagaman ang input parameter na `instance` ay opsyonal, inirerekomenda na palagi kang magbigay ng impormasyong ito, maliban kung gusto mong gumamit ng isang service para magtrabaho sa maraming instance. Sa sitwasyong ito, tingnan ang seksyon ng [awtomatikong pagpili ng instance](#auto-select).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"saved\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"saved\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start path: Specify saved credentials {#quick-start-path-specify-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Mabilis na simula: Tukuyin ang mga naka-save na credentials {#quick-start-path-specify-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have already saved your credentials, use the following code to apply your default credentials. For instructions to save credentials, see [Save your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Kung nai-save mo na ang iyong mga credentials, gamitin ang sumusunod na code para ilapat ang iyong mga default na credentials. Para sa mga tagubilin sa pag-save ng mga credentials, tingnan ang [I-save ang iyong mga access credentials.](/guides/save-credentials)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you named one or more sets of credentials - for example, for open and premium access - use the following code to use a set of named credentials.\n"
msgstr "Kung pinangalanan mo ang isa o higit pang mga set ng credentials — halimbawa, para sa open at premium access — gamitin ang sumusunod na code para gumamit ng isang set ng mga pinangalanang credentials.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations when loading saved credentials {#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Mga bagay na dapat isaalang-alang kapag naglo-load ng mga naka-save na credentials {#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you initialize a service with `token` and `name`, the `token` is ignored and the saved details from the `name` account are loaded.\n"
msgstr "Kung mag-initialize ka ng service gamit ang `token` at `name`, ang `token` ay binabalewala at ang mga naka-save na detalye mula sa `name` account ay nilo-load.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the service loads the details from `account_A` and does not use `token_B`:\n"
msgstr "    Sa sumusunod na halimbawa, nilo-load ng service ang mga detalye mula sa `account_A` at hindi ginagamit ang `token_B`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(token=\"token_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you provide a `name` and an `instance` when initializing a service, the service tries to load the `name` account **and** connect to the specified `instance`. If there is any conflict, a warning is raised.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(token=\"token_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Kung magbigay ka ng `name` at `instance` kapag nagsi-initialize ng service, sinusubukan ng service na i-load ang `name` account **at** kumonekta sa tinukoy na `instance`. Kung may anumang salungatan, mag-a-abot ng babala.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the service tries to load the credentials for `account_A` and use instance `CRN_B` - even if there is a different instance specified in `account_A`:\n"
msgstr "    Sa sumusunod na halimbawa, sinusubukan ng service na i-load ang mga credentials para sa `account_A` at gamitin ang instance na `CRN_B` — kahit na may ibang instance na tinukoy sa `account_A`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- The service tries to load the default saved account only if you don't provide a `token` or `name` when initializing a service.  However, if an `instance` is provided explicitly, the service tries to connect to that instance by using the default credentials. If there is any conflict, a warning is raised.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Sinusubukan ng service na i-load ang default na naka-save na account tanging kung hindi ka nagbibigay ng `token` o `name` kapag nagsi-initialize ng service. Gayunpaman, kung tahasan na ibinigay ang `instance`, sinusubukan ng service na kumonekta sa instance na iyon gamit ang mga default na credentials. Kung may anumang salungatan, mag-a-abot ng babala.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the service tries to load the default credentials and use the instance `CRN_B` - even if there is a different instance specified in the default account:\n"
msgstr "    Sa sumusunod na halimbawa, sinusubukan ng service na i-load ang mga default na credentials at gamitin ang instance na `CRN_B` — kahit na may ibang instance na tinukoy sa default na account:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you save multiple sets of credentials but don't specify one when initializing the service and there is no default saved account, the one whose name comes last alphabetically is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Kung mag-save ka ng maraming set ng credentials ngunit hindi mo tinutukoy ang isa kapag nag-initialize ng service at walang default na naka-save na account, ang pinaka-huli sa alpabeto ang gagamitin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the user saved accounts named \"my_premium\" and \"my_open\" but didn't mark either as the dfault.  They then initialized the service by using the following code. In this case, the \"my_premium\" credentials are used:\n"
msgstr "    Sa sumusunod na halimbawa, nag-save ang user ng mga account na pinangalanang \"my_premium\" at \"my_open\" ngunit hindi niya minarkahan ang alinman bilang default. Pagkatapos ay nag-initialize sila ng service gamit ang sumusunod na code. Sa kasong ito, ginagamit ang mga credentials ng \"my_premium\":\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you are persistently getting the error \"401 Unauthorized\", you might be trying to use a [bearer token](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment) instead of your API key.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Kung patuloy kang nakakakuha ng error na \"401 Unauthorized\", maaaring sinusubukan mong gumamit ng [bearer token](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment) sa halip na ang iyong API key.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically select the instance {#automatically-select-the-instance}"
msgstr "Awtomatikong piliin ang instance {#automatically-select-the-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you provide a token but **don't provide an instance CRN** when instantiating the service, `QiskitRuntimeService` authenticates to the account identified by the token and uses automatic instance selection to choose the most relevant instance for the requested task. If you have several instances available within your account, the service automatically chooses from the available instances, depending on the resource requested and these `QiskitRuntimeService` options (if set): `plans_preference`, `region`, `tags`.\n"
msgstr "Kung magbigay ka ng token ngunit **hindi magbibigay ng instance CRN** kapag nagsi-instantiate ng service, ang `QiskitRuntimeService` ay nagpapatunay sa account na natukoy ng token at gumagamit ng awtomatikong pagpili ng instance para piliin ang pinaka-angkop na instance para sa hiniling na gawain. Kung mayroon kang maraming instance na available sa loob ng iyong account, awtomatikong pumipili ang service mula sa mga available na instance, depende sa hiniling na resource at sa mga opsyon ng `QiskitRuntimeService` na ito (kung itinakda): `plans_preference`, `region`, `tags`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`plans_preference`**: The types of instance plans to prioritize. For example, if [`open`] is passed in, only Open Plan instances are available. Accepted values are `open`, `premium`, `pay-as-you-go`, `flex`, and `on-prem`. If `plans_preference` is not specified, free plans are prioritized over paid plans.\n"
msgstr "**`plans_preference`**: Ang mga uri ng instance plan na uunahin. Halimbawa, kung [`open`] ay ipinasa, available lamang ang mga Open Plan instance. Ang mga tinatanggap na value ay `open`, `premium`, `pay-as-you-go`, `flex`, at `on-prem`. Kung hindi tinukoy ang `plans_preference`, ang mga libreng plan ay uunahin kaysa sa mga bayad na plan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`region`**: The instance region. Accepted values are `us-east` and `eu-de`.\n"
msgstr "**`region`**: Ang rehiyon ng instance. Ang mga tinatanggap na value ay `us-east` at `eu-de`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`tags`**: The instance tags. Accepts a list of tag name strings.\n"
msgstr "**`tags`**: Ang mga tag ng instance. Tumatanggap ng listahan ng mga string ng pangalan ng tag.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You can set up your [saved credentials](/guides/save-credentials) to automatically select an instance.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Maaari mong i-set up ang iyong [mga naka-save na credentials](/guides/save-credentials) para awtomatikong pumili ng instance.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instance is found and used in this order:\n"
msgstr "Ang instance ay nahanap at ginagamit sa sumusunod na pagkakasunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account only has access to one instance, it is selected by default.\n"
msgstr "Kung ang iyong account ay may access lamang sa isang instance, ito ay awtomatikong pinipili.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If saved credentials are being used and an instance was specified with the credentials, that instance is used. See [Considerations when loading saved credentials](#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Kung ginagamit ang mga naka-save na credentials at tinukoy ang isang instance kasama ang mga credentials, gagamitin ang instance na iyon. Tingnan ang [Mga bagay na dapat isaalang-alang kapag naglo-load ng mga naka-save na credentials.](#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "If your account has multiple instances that can access the requested QPU, the system uses your specified plan preferences to choose a plan and instance. For Qiskit Runtime v0.42 and later, free plans are prioritized by default.\n"
msgid "If your account has multiple instances that can access the requested QPU, the system uses your specified plan preferences to choose a plan and instance. For `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42 and later, free plans are prioritized by default.\n"
msgstr "Kung ang iyong account ay mayroon maraming instance na maaaring ma-access ang hiniling na QPU, ginagamit ng system ang iyong tinukoy na mga kagustuhan sa plan para pumili ng plan at instance. Para sa Qiskit Runtime v0.42 at mas bago, ang mga libreng plan ay uunahin bilang default.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account has access to multiple instances but only one can access the requested QPU, the instance with access is selected. If this instance is not associated with a free plan, a cost will be incurred.\n"
msgstr "Kung ang iyong account ay may access sa maraming instance ngunit isa lang ang maaaring ma-access ang hiniling na QPU, ang instance na may access ay pinipili. Kung ang instance na ito ay hindi nauugnay sa isang libreng plan, magkakaroon ng bayad.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples {#examples}"
msgstr "Mga Halimbawa {#examples}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to the account to find ones that can access the specified backend:\n"
msgstr "Sa halimbawang ito, hinahanap ng service ang lahat ng instance na available sa account para mahanap ang mga maaaring ma-access ang tinukoy na backend:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to the account in the EU region to find ones that can access the specified backend:\n"
msgstr "Sa halimbawang ito, hinahanap ng service ang lahat ng instance na available sa account sa rehiyon ng EU para mahanap ang mga maaaring ma-access ang tinukoy na backend:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to the account and are tagged as `services` to find ones that can access the specified backend:\n"
msgstr "Sa halimbawang ito, hinahanap ng service ang lahat ng instance na available sa account at may tag na `services` para mahanap ang mga maaaring ma-access ang tinukoy na backend:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all premium and open instances that are available to the account to find ones that can access the specified backend. If a backend is in both a Premium and an Open Plan instance, the Premium Plan instance is prioritized because `premium` is specified first in `plans_preference`.\n"
msgstr "Sa halimbawang ito, hinahanap ng service ang lahat ng premium at open instance na available sa account para mahanap ang mga maaaring ma-access ang tinukoy na backend. Kung ang isang backend ay nasa parehong Premium at Open Plan instance, ang Premium Plan instance ay uunahin dahil `premium` ay tinukoy nang una sa `plans_preference`.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Determine which instance was chosen {#determine-which-instance-was-chosen}"
msgstr "Alamin kung aling instance ang napili {#determine-which-instance-was-chosen}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The selected instance is returned as a warning. Additionally, you can run `service.active_instance()` to determine the active instance.\n"
msgstr "Ang napiling instance ay ibinabalik bilang isang babala. Bukod dito, maaari kang magpatakbo ng `service.active_instance()` para matukoy ang aktibong instance.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Local testing with Qiskit Runtime {#local-testing-with-qiskit-runtime}"
msgid "Local testing with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#local-testing-with-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "Lokal na pagsubok gamit ang Qiskit Runtime {#local-testing-with-qiskit-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `QiskitRuntimeService` class can be initialized with `channel=local` to perform local simulation. In this case, authentication is not required and there is no need to provide values for `token` or `instance`. Therefore, it is not recommended that you save a local account.  Instead, you can do direct instantiation:\n"
msgstr "Ang klase ng `QiskitRuntimeService` ay maaaring ma-initialize gamit ang `channel=local` para magsagawa ng lokal na simulation. Sa kasong ito, hindi kailangan ang authentication at hindi na kailangang magbigay ng mga value para sa `token` o `instance`. Kaya naman, hindi inirerekomenda na mag-save ka ng lokal na account. Sa halip, maaari kang gumamit ng direktang instantiation:\n"

